      "order": 0,
      "latex": "$$=\\frac{k(x_1-4)\\times(2x_2-5)+3k(x_2-4)}{2x_2-5}$$"
    },
    {
      "category": "equation_isolated",
      "order": 1,
      "latex": "$$= k\\frac{2{x}_{1}{x}_{2} - 5\\left( {{x}_{1} + {x}_{2}}\\right)  + 8}{2{x}_{2} - 5} = k\\frac{2 \\times  \\frac{{64}{k}^{2} - {12}}{3 + 4{k}^{2}} - 5 \\times  \\frac{{32}{k}^{2}}{3 + 4{k}^{2}} + 8}{2{x}_{2} - 5}$$"
    },
    {
      "category": "equation_isolated",
      "order": 2,
      "latex": "$$= k\\frac{\\frac{{128}{k}^{2} - {24} - {160}{k}^{2} + {24} + {32}{k}^{2}}{3 + 4{k}^{2}}}{2{x}_{2} - 5} = 0,$$"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "故$y _ { 1 } = y _ { Q }$，即$A Q \\perp y$轴."
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "【点睛】方法点睛：利用韦达定理法解决直线与圆锥曲线相交问题的基本步骤如下："
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "（1）设直线方程，设交点坐标为$(x_{1},y_{1}),(x_{2},y_{2})$；"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "（2）联立直线与圆锥曲线的方程，得到关于$x$（或$y$）的一元二次方程，注意$\\Delta$的判断；"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "（3）列出韦达定理；"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "（4）将所求问题或题中的关系转化为$x _ { 1 } + x _ { 2 }$、$x _ { 1 } x _ { 2 }$(或$y _ { 1 } + y _ { 2 }$、$y _ { 1 } y _ { 2 }$）的形式；"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "（5）代入韦达定理求解."
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "21. 已知函数$f \\left( x \\right) = \\left( 1 - a x \\right) \\ln \\left( 1 + x \\right) - x \\ .$"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "（1）当$a=-2$时，求$f(x)$的的极值；"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "（2）当$x \\ge 0$时，$f(x) { \\geq } 0$恒成立，求$a$的取值范围."
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "【答案】(1）极小值为0，无极大值."
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "(2)$ a \\leq - \\frac{1}{2} $"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "【解析】"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "【分析】（1）求出函数的导数，根据导数的单调性和零点可求函数的极值."
    },
